:"","content":"Sailor Moon Crystal vs. original Sailor Moon anime: I never realized just how much filler the original anime has. Crystal is up to episode 5, and we\u2019re up to four Sailor Senshi, with Mercury, Mars, and Jupiter introduced in episodes 2, 3, and 5, respectively; in the original anime, they were introduced in episodes 8, 10, and 29, respectively. These days, there are entire shows that end their runs in less time than it took to introduce Jupiter. Heck, there are shows that have entire runs shorter than the number of episodes it took to get from Mars to Jupiter. <br /> <br /> I think that this is a big part of the reason why Usagi came across as such a ditz in the original anime: the time she spent in her initial \u201cditz\u201d phase (before her more positive traits came to the fore) got dragged out a lot, which established her ditziness more firmly and resulted in it sticking around longer. From what I\u2019m seeing in Crystal, her caring nature is being highlighted much more quickly, and her laziness is already dialing down a bit \u2014 though it\u2019s still there a bit in episode 5.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"htt