f the English translations for Muv-Luv are any good? I want to get in on this series from the beginning, but I don't know Japanese.</div> </div> </div> </div>They are fine.there are a couple of odd translations but nothing unreadable or terrible. Minor spoiler here. There is a tentacle scene but it is extremely relevant to the plot an occurs in alternative (the third part of the series [technically the second game as you read extra then unlimited which are on the same disk but unlimited is only unlocked after the sumika and meiya routes are finished.]). I highly recommend it. Alternative is often referred to as the PTSD portion of the game. Im not going to explain why. Muv luv is one of the few series where in the VAns I didn't view all of the sex scenes as tacked on. The three main girls are fantastic and their personalities add quite a bit. Many of the occurrences add layers to the settings g (I recommend in alternative, which doesn't have branching archs, you choose to hear all details as it expands the universe and what is going on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-31T21:21:33-07:00","id":298663,"title":"","content":"Some time later: GRAAAAAHHHHH!<br /> <br /> ...Okay, next question: How the heck do I get a copy of this game in the USA? The internet doesn't seem to want to make any copies available to me at all, let alone any that are compatible with fan translations.<br /> <br /> Now how I know how frustrating it is for people in other countries to get specific items of American media in a intelligible language. =/<br /> <br /> Edit: Okay, I think I found a way. Here goes nothing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":175,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","user":"Prometheus878","date":". 11-01-2014, 12:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-02T04:42:45-08:00","id":299913,"title":"","content":"Enjoy extra. Its really funny and helps with the all important character and setting building. No giant robots yet though, its a comedy Vn.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T05:19:47-08:00","id":300996,"title":"","content":"Fate/Apocrypha's translation speeded up, I think I will at least read first volume again before 2nd one finishes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-ka