thing to do with this new project. Since it's being designed by an entirely different group of people, that killed pretty much any interest that I otherwise would have had in it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Animation quality is so much worse, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T05:11:27-07:00","id":1220789,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2441-lets-talk-anime-manga-visual-novels-light-novels?p=1213100#post1213100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> He also had a separate concept for a manga about a boy (who also had a similar design and personality to Naruto) who went to a school for wizards. But then Harry Potter came out and he (or maybe his editors) decided not to go forward with that idea because it would likely be viewed as imitating Harry Potter.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Actually, I just realized that fanfiction.net has 2,408 cross over fics involving Naruto and Harry Potter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 05-21-2018, 08:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"