lue":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-10T20:19:47-07:00","id":1260062,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2441-lets-talk-anime-manga-visual-novels-light-novels?p=1260033#post1260033\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sooooo, how about that Goblin Slayer? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>How's the anime? I really like the manga - it started off pretty dark and brutal but settled into a more comfortable pace down the road. I really like his party, and it's fun seeing a Vancian D&amp;D setting with some trappings of Japanese RPGs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 10-10-2018, 11:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-10T20:37:09-07:00","id":1260064,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2441-lets-talk-anime-manga-visual-novels-light-novels?p=1260062#post1260062\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How's the anime? I really like the manga - it started off pretty dark and brutal but settled into a more comfortable pace down the road. I really like his party, and it's fun seeing a Vancian D&amp;D setting with some trappings of Japanese RPGs.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I only just found out about it today. Apparently there's only 1 episode out right now?<br /> <br /> I don't know how well it holds up to the manga, but I will say the people on Youtube are comparing the Goblin Slayer to Doom Guy!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-10T20:53:40-07:00","id":1260070,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2441-lets-talk-anime-manga-visual-novels-light-novels?p=1229264#post1229264\">The manga and light novel have been out for a while now.</a><br /> <br /> They went for a weird way to get attention in their first story and it seems to have gathered the most attention of the series.<br /> <br /> He's kind of like Punisher, if he refused to be concerned with supervillains. Goblins all the way. Though Doom Guy and Punisher are more willing to use better equipment when it becomes available.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 10-10-2018, 11:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-10T20:58:43-07:00","id":1260073,"title":"","content":"Only one episode so far, yes. I just viewed it at your recommendation, and my first impression was how brutal it is. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">We see a party of newbs get cut down by goblins, and they specifically show the blood, the trauma, and a rape \u2014 the latter of which fortunately takes place off-screen, but only after they've made damn sure you know what the goblins' intentions are. After the titular Goblin Slayer arrives and butchers the goblins, his final act before leaving the tunnels is to massacre a group of defenseless goblin children. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-11T03:00:51-07:00","id":1260098,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2441-lets-talk-anime-manga-visual-novels-light-novels?p=1260070#post1260070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They went for a weird way to get attention in their first story and it seems to have gathered the most attention of the series.<br /> <br /> He's kind of like Punisher, if he refused to be concerned with supervillains. Goblins all the way. Though Doom Guy and Punisher are more willing to use better equipment when it becomes available.</div> </div> </div> </div>I tried looking up some images of the manga on google, and saw a page where he's facing off a giant ogre. His response is <i>&quot;Feh, you're not a goblin?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> I also found this amusing video:<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DtEM0XYGy2s\" target=\"_blank\">Goblin Slayer Honest Description</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-13T06:30:38-07:00","id":1260429,"title":"","content":"I really, <i>really </i>don't like the kind of horror and trauma Goblin Slayer goes for. Don't like it in Fantasy, don't like it in Horror, don't like it in RPGs and in comics, don't like it in general. I know that's a thing that does not bother some people as it does for me and there are obvious reasons for it to exist in a horror context but hell, I can't help it.<br /> <br /> It was tough to get through it in Berserk and Goblin Slayer is even worse on that side. Way worse, possibly because Berserk's world is almost always bleak and dark while Goblin Slayer's is not.<br /> <br /> The fact I kept on reading is a testament to the manga's quality. It is brutal and mercilless but I honestly can't say it's a bad manga. In fact, I think it's quite good and that it treats its darkest elements with all the seriousness and dramatic weight the nature of the series allows it to have.<br /> <br /> I hesitate to call it &quot;entertaining&quot; and the monsters are so vile that when the titular character does what he's best at I can't fully appreciate the catharsis, but I still read all the manga and its spin-offs, so that has to mean something.<br /> <br /> Can't exactly recommend it, but if you like Dark Fantasy and manage to endure through it, the series quality only improves with time. I feel like I'm always a chapter away from dropping it, but I'm still there.<br /> <br /> Also yes, the party and the supporting characters are great and Goblin Slayer deserves a place in the Hall of Fame of brutal anti-heroes, along with Punisher, Doom Guy and Guts","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 10-13-2018, 12:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-29T18:43:07-08:00","id":1277426,"title":"","content":"So, this season of Goblin Slayer is over and I've got to say, as somebody who's a primarily anime only viewer, the Goblin Lord arc was disappointing. It seems to me like the only reason people were hyping this part up was because of the &quot;meat shield&quot; scene, which was heavily censored in the anime. I was expecting the Goblin Lord to be some kind of actual threat, but his army got taken out pretty easily, and even the Goblin Lord himself wasn't all that impressive.<br /> <br /> Another thing I'm not very pleased with is how the anime is apparently deciding to omit going into detail about character backstories. This was an especially important moment for Goblin Lord, since I felt like his backstory and his internal monologue show off precisely why Goblins are an existential threat that needs to be wiped out. But by choosing not to include these parts in the anime, they make Goblins come across as being more like mindless animals, than the cruel, malicious race they're revealed to be in the manga.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-29T19:14:12-08:00","id":1277431,"title":"","content":"In the light novel he's not really expanded on much. Yes, it's clear he's a particularly malicious or evil goblin but beyond being more cunning than the average goblin he seems just like the rest of them, but bigger.<br /> <br /> It's standard fantasy, a lot of people seemed to glom onto the rape like it was part of the pulp hero push that we had a couple years back, just in Japan, but it isn't. It's also not entirely clear (at least early on) how dangerous goblins actually are, as most of it is seen through the biased eyes of someone who's dedicated his life to them, yet the world beyond his territory seems to keep chugging along with goblins being handled by newbies. As the interludes with the gods point out he's just a wild card in larger schemes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 12-29-2018, 10:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-29T19:29:40-08:00","id":1277432,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2441-lets-talk-anime-manga-visual-novels-light-novels?p=1277431#post1277431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the light novel he's not really expanded on much. Yes, it's clear he's a particularly malicious or evil goblin but beyond being more cunning than the average goblin he seems just like the rest of them, but bigger.<br /> <br /> It's standard fantasy, a lot of people seemed to glom onto the rape like it was part of the pulp hero push that we had a couple years back, just in Japan, but it isn't. It's also not entirely clear (at least early on) how dangerous goblins actually are, as most of it is seen through the biased eyes of someone who's dedicated his life to them, yet the world beyond his territory seems to keep chugging along with goblins being handled by newbies. As the interludes with the gods point out he's just a wild card in larger schemes.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What I meant by his backstory expanding on him is that it shows off why Goblin Slayer was able to so easily wipe out the &quot;defenseless&quot; Goblin children. If anybody was still wondering what would happen if they had spared the children from episode 1, the Goblin Lord serves as an example. Even though they were crying and shivering, even though they were probably only a few months old, they would have killed the Priestess the very second she turned her back to them.<br /> <br /> We know this because the Goblin Lord did the exact same thing when an adventurer took pity on him. The moment she turned around, he bashed her skull in with a rock. And this wasn't a one time occurrence either. In the manga it's revealed that he's used this tactic over and over and over again. Every time he plays the pity card, begging for mercy, and every time the hero falls for it, he kills them once they lower their guard.<br /> <br /> Goblins in this series are unapologetically evil, and do not deserve mercy, no matter how pathetic or terrified they pretend to be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-21T13:46:24-08:00","id":1290519,"title":"","content":"My Favorite is Manga and I like to read grand blue manga because this manga characters so nice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25083-antivdovich65621","name":"antivdovich65621","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-28T11:31:33-08:00","id":1292820,"title":"","content":"My favourite is Attack on Titan and I know that this manga is one of the most popular in Japan. Generally, I like reading though last week I was overwhelmed with essays and other college troubles and didn\u2019t have much time for my hobbies<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <hr />In my world of ordinary term papers <a href=\"https://gpalabs.com/\" target=\"_blank\">GPALabs</a> is in great demand","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":25106,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25106-chipper","user":"Chipper","date":". 02-28-2019, 02:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25106-chipper","name":"Chipper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25106_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-20T16:25:20-07:00","id":1326361,"title":"","content":"So apparently A Certain Scientific Accelerator is out, and I must say I do like what I see, both in animation and storywise (the additions to the manga are quit nice for now, and I like that they showed that Esther as more capable than it looked like in the first manga chapter). While it looks really good and all, I'm still eagerly waiting for the third season of Railgun, which is my favorite manga until now (and I hope it will cover the whole Exterior arc, as it was really good IMO).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-20T21:24:26-07:00","id":1326400,"title":"","content":"I liked Railgun quite a bit, and enjoy reading the manga each month, but I dropped Index a little way into the third season. Maybe I'll finish it off next month. I haven't checked out Accelerator yet nor read the manga, though I've heard a fair number of good things about it, so I think I'll start watching it to see what the fuss is about.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-11T04:53:22-07:00","id":1330371,"title":"","content":"A crest of stars currently has a new translation, and is available on kindle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-27T13:21:02-07:00","id":1338173,"title":"","content":"So I've watched the last episode of A Certain Scientific Accelerator, and I must say that while I liked most of what I have seen trough the season, the ending of the Necromancer saga in the manga was much better than that in the anime. Issac was seen as a more humanized villain than &quot;destroy them all&quot; one, and Esther was seen as much better heroin. It feels like in the anime, Accelerator stole her thunder, which was really lame. Perhaps on its own the ending is good, narrative wise, but when compared to the manga it becomes much flatter, and miss the point of the whole arc. They also took a much more &quot;anti necromancy&quot; stance than what was presented in the manga. Again, not that it was bad- but the original material was way better, IMO.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-28T03:33:33-07:00","id":1338247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chipper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2441-lets-talk-anime-manga-visual-novels-light-novels?p=1292820#post1292820\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My favourite is Attack on Titan and I know that this manga is one of the most popular in Japan. Generally, I like reading though last week I was overwhelmed with essays and other college troubles and didn\u2019t have much time for my hobbies<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Anime only viewers have no idea what kind of ride they're in for with this series going forward. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-28T03:39:24-07:00","id":1338248,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2441-lets-talk-anime-manga-visual-novels-light-novels?p=1338247#post1338247\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Anime only viewers have no idea what kind of ride they're in for with this series going forward. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>It's pretty great how they made so many twists","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-28T04:54:14-07:00","id":1338251,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2441-lets-talk-anime-manga-visual-novels-light-novels?p=1338248#post1338248\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's pretty great how they made so many twists</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> More twists than a theme park roller coaster!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-28T07:08:12-07:00","id":1338265,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2441-lets-talk-anime-manga-visual-novels-light-novels?p=1338173#post1338173\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I've watched the last episode of A Certain Scientific Accelerator, and I must say that while I liked most of what I have seen trough the season, the ending of the Necromancer saga in the manga was much better than that in the anime. Issac was seen as a more humanized villain than &quot;destroy them all&quot; one, and Esther was seen as much better heroin. It feels like in the anime, Accelerator stole her thunder, which was really lame. Perhaps on its own the ending is good, narrative wise, but when compared to the manga it becomes much flatter, and miss the point of the whole arc. They also took a much more &quot;anti necromancy&quot; stance than what was presented in the manga. Again, not that it was bad- but the original material was way better, IMO.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a very good anime but I think could be even cooler if they could just explain and extend the plot a little more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25632-tzuyu","name":"Tzuyu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25632_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-29T16:37:46-07:00","id":1392694,"title":"","content":"So lately Youtube has started to bombard me with videos about the Pokemon Special manga, and I decided to give it a shot. God, why did it took me so long to read this? It's amazing!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-30T08:03:25-07:00","id":1392807,"title":"","content":"Finally got around to watching Zombieland Saga, after having it on my radar for over a year. (Basically since Mother's Basement <a href=\"https://youtu.be/U7-jbwCX28c\" target=\"_blank\">made a video about it</a> back in late 2018).<br /> <br /> IT GOOD.<br /> <br /> Unlike Jeff, I don't think this will be my gateway into watching idol anime, but it's a good show on its own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-30T08:25:14-07:00","id":1392813,"title":"","content":"Idol anime? Isn't it a Super-sentai show? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"a